{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3DPlatformerTitle.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/ST_GralShowcase.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MOJITO Woody's Rescue puts you on a journey to find your best dog friend Woody, who has been kidnapped by an evil Cucumber, in a cute 3d adventure with sandbox levels, platforming challenges and exploration zones. Inspired by Super Mario 64 - Odyssey / Banjo Kazooie / Celeste</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/CuteDuo.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/MojitoCompanion2.png?t=1749285810\" />Mojito will team up with a lovable companion who makes him both stronger and even cuter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(TO BE REVEALED)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3pov.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/ST_3Cameras.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MOJITO Woody's Rescue combines <strong>Open World, 3D Linear and 2.5D platformer</strong> gameplay styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/WildWagon.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/ST_Wagon.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hold on tight! Wagon levels in <i>MOJITO Woody's Rescue</i> are built for thrill-seekers and explorers alike. Rush through at top speed or ride the rails at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/BrainTitle.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/ST_Puzzles.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not only about action and jumps, you will face multiple mental challenges and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/CustomizationTitle.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/ST_Customize.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize Mojito to look like your favorite cat! Use the editor\u2019s full color palette, pattern selection, and wide range of textures to make it truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/SupportTitle.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/WishlistCall.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mojito needs your help! If you like this project, please consider supporting it on kickstarter and Wishlisting on Steam!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1664720?t=1749285810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/4ae71abb64ff0206cd76365d8188cd14af8e6da3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749285810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/594c7fb8ba114235267818c96de45f5123d9c022/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749285810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/594c7fb8ba114235267818c96de45f5123d9c022/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749285810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/3DPlatformerTitle.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/ST_GralShowcase.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MOJITO Woody's Rescue puts you on a journey to find your best dog friend Woody, who has been kidnapped by an evil Cucumber, in a cute 3d adventure with sandbox levels, platforming challenges and exploration zones. Inspired by Super Mario 64 - Odyssey / Banjo Kazooie / Celeste</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/CuteDuo.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: