</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/CustomizationTitle.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/ST_Customize.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize Mojito to look like your favorite cat! Use the editor\u2019s full color palette, pattern selection, and wide range of textures to make it truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/SupportTitle.png?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/extras/WishlistCall.gif?t=1749285810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mojito needs your help! If you like this project, please consider supporting it on kickstarter and Wishlisting on Steam!</p>","developers":["GTZAStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664720/072cb8a66e10f44c5b0287dbba959819e5d53e59/header.jpg?t=1749285810","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152774,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152774/movie480.mp4?t=1749285803","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152774/movie_max.mp4?t=1749285803"},"name":"Gameplay2025_40Secs","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152774/a6b2152c13c51946